    "Field changes are saved only when you tap Save. Photos and newly created locations are saved immediately. Close discards unsaved field changes." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "只有轻点“保存”才会保存字段更改。照片和新建位置会立即保存。“关闭”会丢弃未保存的字段更改。" } } } },
